c-link" href="/encyclopedia/uruk">Uruk</a>, proclaims himself king of Ur.</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">c. 2334 BCE</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sargon-of-akkad">Sargon of Akkad</a> conquers Ur and installs his daughter <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/enheduanna">Enheduanna</a> as high priestess of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/nanna">Nanna</a>.</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">22nd century BCE</span><span class="rf-text">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/akkadian-empire">Akkadian Empire</a> ends under Sharkalisharri; Ur passes to Gutian or local rule and then to the influence of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lagash">Lagash</a> under Ur-Bau and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/gudea">Gudea</a>.</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">c. 2112 BCE</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ur-nammu">Ur-Nammu</a>, governor of Ur under <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/utu-hengal">Utu-hengal</a> of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/uruk">Uruk</a>, moves the kingship to Ur and founds the Third Dynasty.</span></li></ol>
